## 5. Integration notes

- **Pattern.** Load the reference data (security master, look-through, CMA, models, shelf, benchmarks, history, research) into one portfolio analytics store, refreshed daily or on change. Read the client data (positions, lots, profile, target, goals, tax, cash flows, sleeves) per request through services, or from a nightly snapshot.
- **Joins.** Household â account â sleeve â position â lot â security. Fund â underlying security. Security â asset class / sector / rating.
- **Snapshot and audit.** Each run stores the as-of dates, the policy snapshot ID and the inputs used. The run trace already records the policy, evidence and checks.
- **Write-back (later).** Save the recommendation and its proposed trades for advisor approval. Hand approved trades to the order or rebalancing system. Do not trade from Portfolio Review directly.
- **Licensing.** Fund research (e.g. Morningstar) and index data have redistribution terms. Check what may be shown to advisors and what may go into client material.
- **Entitlements.** Research ratings and some product data are restricted. Apply the advisor's entitlements before display.

